                                "sense_id": "f01d0588-85a4-37c2-96f6-3e7e84d1f4b2",
                                "text": "The vegetables when they started to grow in this plot seemed pretty sickly until one day a group of medical students doused them with antibug powder..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c6051a7-3d90-4026-b21f-195394f5390b",
                                "sense_id": "f01d0588-85a4-37c2-96f6-3e7e84d1f4b2",
                                "text": "Use it with an antibug candle and it wards off pests while it lights your patio."
